⚠️ Lesson duration: 50 minutes ⚠️

In this course, you will:

✔️ Get your grammar & pronunciation mistakes corrected; 
✔️ Learn new vocabulary in different everyday topics;
✔️ Make your passive vocabulary active again;
✔️ Make your speech more automatic by learning sentence structures;
✔️ and evidently, improve your confidence in speaking English.
